<h1>Free Online PDF Tools</h1>
<p class="intro">Merge PDF files, split PDF pages and convert PDF pages into images with our free online PDF tools.</p>
<div class="panel">

<div class="tool">
<h2>1. Merge PDF Files</h2>
<p>Combine multiple PDF documents into one file.</p>
<label>Select PDF files</label>
<input type="file" id="mergeFiles" accept="application/pdf" multiple>
<button onclick="mergePDF()">Merge PDF</button>
<div class="msg" id="mergeMsg"></div>
</div>

